WEBVTT

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.570
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.570
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:18.120
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:30.710
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:37.340
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:45.270
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:26.230
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:41.130
The teamwork of that guy Rommel's
old mobile suits was just amazing.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.750
They had real power.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.890
They taught me that fighting spirit
isn't about mobile suit performance.

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.190
But I imagine there's an oasis
near that battlefield,

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:54.560
where someone's crying now.

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.770
That's why we...

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:02.240
MASAI'S HEART

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.990
This is how you wanted it, right, Tag?

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.820
I checked all the mechanisms today,
just as you taught me.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.090
Tag...

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.740
They're here.
I know you see it too, Tag.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:45.160
Nobody's really trying to stop the
spread of the desert around here,

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.420
so there's no end to the sand.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:57.930
The landscape's been the same for so long...
I'm not gonna find an oasis.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.050
I think that's what you call a camel!

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:06.130
Yeah, all right! Camels are supposed
to have water in their humps, right?

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:13.840
You're not getting away!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.970
Camel! Wait!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.420
WAIT!

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:24.720
There, there...

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.820
Did you startle this camel?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.190
I'm looking for water.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.950
I thought I'd get the
water inside its hump.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.800
You can't get water
out of a camel's hump!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.440
Thanks for the help.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:44.620
The law of the desert...
is to help people in trouble.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.610
Were you crossing the desert
with just that fighter?

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.780
Oh, no I'm not.
I'm with some people in mobile suits.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.750
We're looking for water.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.360
That's true of most people
who come here.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.980
They're all looking for the oasis.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.760
Tag, you were like that, too.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.260
Where are your friends?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.040
Let's see, which way was it...

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.480
There was a rock with
this kinda shape.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.200
The oasis is nearby.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.390
Hop on!

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.110
Sorry for the trouble.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.980
T-This is...

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.140
Okay!

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.730
So hot...

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.730
Is Judau back?

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.110
No, no! Hot!

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.310
Then stay quiet!

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.890
Roux... what in the world is going on?!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.710
The oasis is nearby, right?

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:49.870
This is weird...

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.890
Isn't this map from before the war?!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.970
Have we been following
this half-assed map?!

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:58.780
There was no choice!
This is the only map we have!

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.010
You just don't want to take the blame!

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.770
- That's not true!
- So hot...

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:05.550
You're the professional soldier here!

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:07.310
Hey, you're all soldiers, too!

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.520
Stop it, Elle.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.590
You too, Roux!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:11.970
Don't touch me. It's already hot out.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.030
Calm down, Elle!

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:14.060
Don't stop me!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.270
Stop it.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.560
Let go! Are both of you
siding with Roux?!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:23.430
We're siding with getting water!
That's all the water we have now!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:24.980
You don't understand
our situation at all.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.410
Of course I do!
You're just being stubborn!

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.590
What did you say?!

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.250
Lukewarm...

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.290
Ple!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:43.580
What a brat! I put up with it till now,
but I can't take this anymore!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.750
What?!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.840
You! I hope you dry up like a mud brick!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:50.080
Let's dig a hole and bury her!
You know, with just her head sticking out!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.310
No, no, no!

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.710
- Shut up!
- Stop!

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.290
- Let's tie her to the back of the Mk. II!
- You demon! You devil!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.430
Right now, that armor's so hot
you could fry an egg on it!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.700
Stop! You devil!

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:04.310
You're the devil! You keep using
water without thinking about it!

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.080
Elle, Roux...

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.270
I have to stop them.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.400
I don't think you could.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.520
It's the heat.
It's all the heat's fault!

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.920
You don't get to be
in the shade anymore!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.530
Not until you promise not
to use any more water!

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.970
There's more water?

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.970
OF COURSE NOT!

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.200
Judau... where's Judau?

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.470
Judau left you and ran off.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.600
He snuck out while you were asleep.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:26.960
You're kidding!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.820
Judau! Judau!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.520
That's going too far. You can't let her run off
alone into the middle of the desert.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:36.210
Ple just doused herself with
the last of our drinking water!

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.350
But still...

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:42.310
Judau! Where did you go, Judau!

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.920
You big dummy!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.910
Judau?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.360
Judau!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.320
Judau?

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:55.650
Is that him?

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.990
Judau!

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.320
Judau, where have you been!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.110
Ple?

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:02.640
Dummy, dummy! You left me, Judau!

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.930
I was just out looking for water.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:06.580
Elle and Roux are being mean!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:14.000
She's going to guide us to
a village where there's water.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.420
Really?!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:18.000
I didn't expect this many.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.650
Yeah...

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:24.640
Don't drink too much.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.220
You're not going to
take us to the village?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.930
I-I have work to do.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:34.390
Go straight toward where the shadows
point and you'll see it soon.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.030
Told you so! Your lousy
map was getting us lost.

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.550
Are you ever gonna let that go?

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.340
Stop bickering!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.070
Thanks.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:43.930
I was only following the
law of the desert.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.250
Thanks!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.800
Judau... what'd you do with that lady?

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.270
Knock it off! She barely
even talked to me.

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.410
So what's her name?

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.690
Name?

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.960
Come to think of it...

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:03.370
When I saw her eyes, I felt like
my heart was being wrung out.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.890
She has a very lonely heart.

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:08.090
A lonely heart?

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:13.040
Judau! Let's go to the oasis village!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.410
I'm a bit worried about
the Core Fighter.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.970
Me too!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.110
Wait a minute! Judau!
You can go get that later!

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:22.580
Let's rendezvous after
we get some water.

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:26.120
I'm gonna go with Judau!

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:30.570
Tag... the mobile suits you were
waiting for are finally here.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.290
Bear it just a little longer.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:35.830
Soon, everyone will
come to understand you.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:46.260
It was this close?!

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.280
Roux! I found the oasis!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.290
Try not to use the radio too much.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.310
The Minovsky particle
density is really low!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.720
Why do you think we're walking?!

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:05.430
WATER!

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:11.350
Elle! Don't provoke the villagers!

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:14.610
I know! But what's that
triangular building?

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.110
Be careful! Isn't that a mosque?

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.080
What's a mosque?

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.010
A place of worship.
You know, like a church?

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.490
Th-That machine...
what did it come here for...?

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:29.240
Everyone, continue your prayers.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.250
Elder...!

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.090
Water! Water!

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.390
We have to ask for it properly!

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:34.790
I know!

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.020
Don't worry!

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.370
There! There it is!

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.900
Judau! Water!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.200
You're the one who said you
were tagging along with me!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.300
Meanie!

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.470
Hey, Judau...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.910
Tag... I prepared things
just as you taught me.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:23.160
But I have to fight their machines.

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.210
Help me, Tag.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:27.850
A mobile suit?! You're with Zeon?!

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.840
You didn't go to the village?!

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.560
Why do you have to pilot this?

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.180
I'll show them the power
of Tag's Gelgoog!

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.670
Show us? Is that why you--

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:40.120
If I defeat you,
the people in the village...

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.240
Don't!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.470
Stop it! Let go!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.470
Not gonna!

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.050
It's for Tag... I have to fight for Tag!

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:49.100
Did he tell you to do this?!

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:50.800
I'm doing this in Tag's place!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.390
Don't let go!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.270
Judau!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.510
Open up!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.970
Ple, why did you let go of her?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.390
Because...

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.360
Tag... I'm going to move it now.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.560
Open up!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.780
Judau...

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.180
Ple!

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.700
A Zeon mobile suit?!

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:14.330
Judau!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.430
Tag... here I go! Protect me!

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:24.560
Wow, amazing!

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.870
It's a mobile suit!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.260
We just want some water from the oasis!

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:31.710
It's strange for you to be
merely passing by this area.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.280
That's right!
You're just like that man...

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.750
Stand back!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.600
We'll go as soon as we've gotten
some water, so please...

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:42.920
We have not a single drop of water to
give to people who pilot those things!

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.940
You desert dwellers shouldn't
say things like that!

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:46.990
Quiet!

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:53.230
With your flying machines or mobile suits, you
should be able to leave this desert immediately.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.930
We heard about this village
from a woman who lives here!

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.300
What?!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:01.830
Just as I thought...
this is Masai's doing.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:15.810
Take your machines and get out!

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:17.560
W-Why is this happening?

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:18.850
W-Wait a minute!

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.190
Let's go!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:21.980
Don't follow them!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:24.070
I see... It is already too late.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.410
E-Elder!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:37.420
Tag... I hear your voice.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:41.110
Make sure you're watching.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.400
There are three enemy units!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.700
I know that, Tag.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:49.660
What's with those guys?!
What did we ever do to them?!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:54.180
The village probably got caught up
in a previous war, and people died.

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.970
So when they
see mobile suits...

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:57.150
What's that?!

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.980
- What's that?!
- Roux! Something strange is coming!

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.190
I know that!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.490
Beecha! Mondo! Get away from here!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:09.900
Roger!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.290
Sheesh, really?!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.820
What the...? Where's that going?

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:18.080
That's... a Gelgoog?
From the old Zeon forces?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.370
- We'll capture it!
- We're playing tag in the desert?!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:25.130
If Haman finds out we're here,
the whole operation's a bust!

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:31.050
But why do all of us have to
chase that old scrapheap?

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.930
Do you really think
that unit's by itself?

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.520
Fine!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.490
Let's go, Tag!

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:46.990
What's it trying to do?

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:57.500
What's wrong?!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.000
I'm opening fire, Tag!

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.180
It's gonna get me!

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:08.750
Malfunction?!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:14.060
I'm at a disadvantage here!
I need to get to those rocks!

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:18.640
This enemy knows the desert.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:20.680
Roux! I'll cover you from the air!

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:22.270
Don't use too much ammo!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.650
Not planning on it!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:27.940
She's strong!

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:30.480
Masai's machine is amazing!

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.570
Don't watch! Return to your homes.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.590
Are you trying to hide? Or escape?

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.300
It evaded!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.430
That one next!

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.230
What the heck?!

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.030
From above, too?

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.910
Even if the monitor visibility's gone...!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.250
That'll never hit me!

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:27.590
W-We can't attack like this...!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:41.020
I was caught off guard...
but I defeated one!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:49.060
- Let's go!
- There's still sand in here!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.030
We're gonna pull it out in one go, okay?

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.150
- Let's go!
- Can we do it?

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.750
We can do it!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.410
You're right!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.660
I'm going to shake the sand off.

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:08.160
I told you to hold on!

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.790
I-I-I got sand down my back!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:13.340
I'll dust the sand off you later.

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:20.050
I gotta be careful around
these stupid rocks.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.310
Over there?!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:27.480
Roux! I found it! It went behind
the rocks to the right!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.940
Which right?

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.360
Look, aren't you too busy
taking care of yourself?!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:41.910
Well then, why don't you hurry up
and catch that piece of scrap metal!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:45.240
Easy for you to say...
That guy's pretty good.

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:46.210
Incoming!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.510
What?!

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.770
Let's do it, Tag!

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:09.190
S-Stop!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:14.200
Wh-What? What's going on?

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.320
We did it, Tag!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:22.250
Just like you said, the sand
here is like quicksand!

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:31.090
- Iino! Pull us up!
- I'm doing it!

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.140
I won't let you!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.510
Damn you!

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:44.260
I'm gonna sink!

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:45.940
You wait there, Mondo!

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:52.980
- Roux, help me!
- Got him!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:17:59.990
What?!

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.420
- Judau!
- What the heck were you doing?!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:07.200
That's my line!

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.420
Why are you guys flailing
against one old mobile suit?!

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:12.000
We're not used to this
desert combat stuff!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:15.890
Stop arguing like that!
Let's hurry up and dock!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:19.630
Got it! Elle, fly up!
We'll dock in midair!

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:21.340
Roger!

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.300
What?!

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:36.780
I-It turned into a mobile suit?!

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.620
Let's go!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.990
I-Incredible power!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:52.200
I know, Tag! We can't win unless we
move faster than the enemy, right?

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:53.960
Let's go!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.130
- She's quick!
- I feel sorry for her.

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:03.800
Stop it! That suit can't
defeat the Double Zeta!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.930
There's no enemy a Gelgoog can't defeat!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.480
That's what Tag taught me!

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.640
You're overpowered!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.400
- Judau!
- Shut up!

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:22.980
Tag's... Tag's mobile suit
can't be beaten!

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:25.160
Do you want to die?

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.830
We can defeat this, right, Tag?

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.870
You have no chance of winning! Why?!

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:37.560
I'm going to restore Tag's honor!
I'm going to show those villagers!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.540
Villagers?

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:41.730
The villagers shunned Tag because
he was an outsider.

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:44.340
They hated his mobile suit,
and they hated Tag!

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.380
That doesn't mean you have to
fight with that mobile suit...

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.800
If I show them the
power of this mobile suit,

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:53.740
the villagers will realize
that Tag was an amazing man!

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:56.520
So why do we have to be your enemy?!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:57.640
Let's stop this, Judau!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:05.830
Tag... this is no good, Tag!
They're going to get us!

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:08.700
You're going to get caught
in the blast! Please, eject!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.820
Ple?

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:13.880
If I stop here... I can't
restore your honor, Tag.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:16.830
If all I'm doing is
following you there...

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:19.220
I can't face down those villagers!

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.790
A guy that makes a woman
fight by herself should--

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.370
That's not it.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:29.130
If I join you now, Tag, the villagers
will curse us both for eternity!

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:32.010
Judau! Save that woman!

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:33.770
Will I make it in time?

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:39.230
- Ple, take over for me!
- Okay!

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:43.070
Judau! What are you doing?!
Hurry up and get away!

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:45.680
- Get out of there!
- Don't touch me!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:48.080
Enough, already... wake up!

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.790
Judau, hurry!

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:52.530
Tag's helmet!

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:53.740
You can't!

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:03.930
Tag!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.680
Well, that's done.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.970
Why don't they simply
get out of a place like this?

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.330
At least there's water here.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:20.350
This isn't the time for chitchat!
We've spent way too long here.

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:21.720
Roger!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.190
Let's go!

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.900
I feel sorry for that woman.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:26.060
Ple...

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:30.490
She's been alone for three years,
ever since that guy Tag died.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:35.290
And now, she'll be alone forever.

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:49.670
Is it all right to
leave Masai like that?

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:54.480
Masai's heart has recovered peace,
along with that machine.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:57.400
Neither will rise again.

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:29.180
Tag...

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:35.390
What... should I do now?

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:52.740
It sounds corny, but the corruption and
depravity of adults was on display in Dakar.

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:58.530
Once I found out Leina was close
to Haman, I rushed in to rescue her!

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:01.200
Karaba came to attack Dakar, too.

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:04.530
Of course, I got to see Leina...
but what followed was terrible!

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:09.090
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Leina's Blood."

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:08.580
Next Time

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:08.580
LEINA'S BLOOD

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:08.580
(Part 1)

00:24:09.520 --> 00:24:11.130
I have a bad feeling about this!
